  "status": "Application Under Consideration",
  "description": "Conversion of dwelling into two flats (1 x 2 bed, 1 x 1 bed), Private amenity space and associated bin and cycle storage",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;The proposal, by reason of the lack of a family sized homes with three or more bedrooms, would fail to achieve an appropriate housing mix, having regard to the location of the site and its surroundings as well as the evidence of local need which identifies the need for more larger family sized units and would fail to contribute to the creation of inclusive and mixed communities, contrary to the provisions of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), policies HO1 and HO2 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;By reasons of lack of direct access to the private outdoor amenity space for Flat B would cumulatively result in sub-standard level of living accommodation for the future occupiers of the proposed dwellings, contrary to Policies D6 of the London Plan (2021), Policies GR1 and HO2 of the Harrow&amp;nbsp; Local Plan (2021-2041), Housing Design Standards London Plan Guidance (2023) and Harrow Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
